OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new village of 3,500
OL,4,Ahomes revived
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new settlement of about
OL,7,F3,500 homes between York and Selby have
OL,8,Fbeen revived after proposals stalled
OL,9,Fduring changes to North Yorkshire's
OL,10,Fplanning system.
OL,12,FEscrick Park Estate said it was
OL,13,Fprogressing plans for Heronby, a new
OL,14,Fcommunity on land west of Escrick which
OL,15,Fwould include schools, a health centre
OL,16,Fand a country park.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
