OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new village of 3,500
OL,4,Ahomes revived
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn initial masterplan was prepared in
OL,7,F2021 as part of the former Selby Local
OL,8,FPlan process but was put on hold after
OL,9,Flocal government reorganisation moved
OL,10,Fplanning responsibilities to North
OL,11,FYorkshire Council in 2023.
OL,13,FAs part of the latest proposals, the
OL,14,Festate has submitted an Environmental
OL,15,FImpact Assessment scoping request to
OL,16,Fthe council.
